ASSUME `an unasked number` IS A NUMBER
ASSUME `an unasked date` IS A DATE
ASSUME `an unasked Applicant` IS A `Applicant`
ASSUME `an unasked Application` IS A `Application`
ASSUME `an unasked Partner` IS A `Partner`
ASSUME `an unasked Transaction` IS A `Transaction`

